Subject: [PATCH v3 1/3] iio: core: Introduce IIO_CHAN_INFO_DEBOUNCE_COUNT and _TIME
Date: Tue, 27 Jan 2015 20:41:52 +0200
Message-Id: <1422384114-23392-2-git-send-email-irina.tirdea@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.9.1
In-Reply-To: <1422384114-23392-1-git-send-email-irina.tirdea@intel.com>
References: <1422384114-23392-1-git-send-email-irina.tirdea@intel.com>
